-- PTAdm_ExtTick calls PTEXT_luawave_Tick() once a minute (protected, "luawave" in PTADM_EXT_NAMES).
-- Tracking is by row index (PTLW_IDX[k] = NPC index, alive while GetNpcName(index) == row name), never by a
-- name scan, so a re-dofile or a second tick cannot duplicate an NPC. Scripts are the VNG ones (PAK paths, GBK
-- bytes): ReLoadScript once per state, then SetNpcScript. Names are TCVN3 (VNG name table aa7f6d50).
-- The tick also clears the servertimer copies of the lbdaosi / hanhtrang pending tables, so they re-read their
-- files every minute (the login hook may have applied and removed an entry - luawave #1).
-- One statement per row (Lua 4 stack). ASCII only.

PTLW_ROWS = {}
PTLW_RN = 0
function PTLW_N(m, tpl, lv, x, y, name, script)
	PTLW_RN = PTLW_RN + 1
	PTLW_ROWS[PTLW_RN] = { m, tpl, lv, x, y, name, script }
end
